src=\"assets/wiki/Freezing_Icon_Big_4dcec8.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 0 1px 1px; width:0.0000%; background-color:#ff3333; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; left:calc(5px + 100% * 0.0000); display:inline-block;\">0%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.1000\" title=\"Fire\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Fire <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Burning Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Burning_Icon_Big_a56686.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:100.0000%; background-color:#27c429; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 0.0000%); display:inline-block;\">110%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0500\" title=\"Energy\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Energy <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Electrified Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Electrified_Icon_Big_b60abe.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:95.4545%; background-color:#27c429; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 4.5455%); display:inline-block;\">105%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"0.0000\" title=\"Earth\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Earth <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Poisoned Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poisoned_Icon_Big_f04eb1.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 0 1px 1px; width:0.0000%; background-color:#ff3333; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; left:calc(5px + 100% * 0.0000); display:inline-block;\">0%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"0.0000\" title=\"Drown\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Drown <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Drowning Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Drowning_Icon_Big_f65e47.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 0 1px 1px; width:0.0000%; background-color:#ff3333; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; left:calc(5px + 100% * 0.0000); display:inline-block;\">0%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Healing\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Healing <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Healing Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Healing_Icon_be4df6.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:90.9091%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 9.0909%); display:inline-block;\">100%</div></div></div>\n</div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Oramond\">Oramond</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Sea%20Serpent%20Area\">Sea Serpent Caves</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Seacrest%20Grounds\">Seacrest Grounds</a> <a href=\"#/wiki/Svargrond\">Svargrond</a> (<a href=\"#/wiki/Sea%20Serpent%20Area\">Sea Serpent Area</a>), <a href=\"#/wiki/Drefia\">Drefia</a> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32968,32452,8\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32968, 32452, 8)</a>). There is also one under <a href=\"#/wiki/Rookgaard%20Academy\">Rookgaard Academy</a>, however it is unreachable.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tA deepsea blood crab rarely retargets.<br/><br/>A deepsea blood crab attacks in melee range. A deepsea blood crab never retreats.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tKnights should just melee. Paladins should use a one-handed weapon (such as royal spears or enchanted spears) and a shield. Mages should use a wand/rod that does energy or death damage and <a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Strike\">exori vis</a>. All vocations should avoid getting surrounded.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-creature-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>These were simply named <i>Blood Crabs</i> before the 2016 Winter Update, which made it hard to differentiate them from the terrestrial <a href=\"#/wiki/Blood%20Crab\">Blood Crabs</a> with the same name.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 8,020 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 500 samples.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<t